'''Frostflame''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was obtained by purchasing the 17th tier of the [[Christmas Event 2024]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It has a black base with glowing blue flame patterns partly covering the blade and handle.

==Trivia==
*This items has a [[Frostflame (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

